    "description": "Rate-limiting evidence for HustleHub+ (Part 2, requirement 7). Run this AFTER the main HustleHub - Gigs collection, and only once.\n\nIt deliberately exhausts the limiters: the booking limiter (per client) and the auth limiter (failed attempts, per IP).\nAfterwards, logins and registrations from this machine are blocked for 15 minutes. Restart the backend (type rs in the nodemon terminal) to clear the limits immediately.",
